INTERPRETATION: the 3 failures (kv_cache, layer, inference) are BY DESIGN.
  test_cpu_only.py V-3/G-1 asserts that these three raise an actionable
  ImportError when matmul_module is absent. The CPU-only install therefore
  exposes exactly 3 importable CPU modules: gguf_parser, tokenizer,
  weight_loader. This is the supported CPU-only surface.

